>
  <Fragment slot="heading">The Acrobat online alternative that never asks you to sign in.</Fragment>
  <Fragment slot="lede">Adobe's online tools are excellent and sit on top of a cloud: sign in, and your documents live in Adobe storage; stay signed out, and the file still passes through Adobe's servers. HatePDF keeps the file on your device for the same everyday jobs. Where Acrobat is genuinely stronger, this page says so.</Fragment>
